      "type": "text",
      "text": "BEFORE & AFTERS"
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "text": "Transforming Smiles, Changing Lives"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Dr. Gonzales is an Diamond Invisalign Provider in Dublin and Tracy, CA. Invisalign straightens your teeth using series of clear, plastic aligners. Our comprehensive dental care services have helped countless patients achieve their dream smiles. Browse through our before-and-after photos to see the transformative results we’ve achieved for our patients. Every smile tells a story of improved confidence and oral health."
    },
    {
      "type": "li",
      "text": "Brightening Smiles"
    },
    {
      "type": "li",
      "text": "Straightening Smiles"
    },
    {
      "type": "li",
      "text": "Perfecting Smiles"
    },
    {
      "type": "li",
      "text": "Restoring Smiles"
    },
    {
      "type": "li",
      "text": "Transforming Smiles"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Gonzales is a science and an art. We combine both disciplines every day to create healthy smiles for our patients. Bronsky Orthodontics is all about the result, delivering care in an intelligent, efficient, and compassionate manner. We believe that the appliances utilized are less important than the care, skill, and judgment applied by the orthodontist in implementing the treatment plan."
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "text": "Swipe Over Images To View Before And After"
    },
    {
