    {
      "type": "li",
      "text": "Advanced Technology By choosing Dante Gonzales Orthodontics for your braces and orthodontic treatment, you are opting for a smile solution that relies all of the latest advancements in modern orthodontic technology."
    },
    {
      "type": "li",
      "text": "Healthcare Solutions When it comes to the health and well-being of our patients, Dante Gonzales Orthodontics, a Tom Terry Certified facility, strives to provide a safe, clean, and protected environment."
    },
    {
      "type": "li",
      "text": "24/7 Availability If you’re like most people, you’re busy! That’s why we offer flexible hours for our patients so that you don’t have to schedule your life around your braces or orthodontic treatment."
    },
    {
      "type": "h4",
      "text": "Let’s see our intro video"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "If your smile is not becoming to you, then you should be coming to me!"
